# scenario: retry-admitted
# doc: retry-admitted.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude retry-admitted.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: launch 1 exits 1 with no result; launch 2 exits 0 with a result
# given: failure returns retry with one extra attempt
event initialize
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event start
work fresh 0
event success
event finalize
err none
exit 0
